  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Take Me Away -&gt; The Grobe**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-04-30.mbho** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 135 min [1]\n- **Ween2003-04-30**: source not stated; 27 songs; 135 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-04-30.mbho**: source: mbho 603 > sound devices mp2 > graham patten adc20 > d8 8th row center [1]\n- **Ween2003-04-30**: Recorded with AKG 460B microphones and CK61 capsules, placed front of house, fifth row, in line with center, via v2 and sbm1 to D8; Taper JK's DAT master was transferred with a Sony PCM-R500 and Marantz PMD661, then processed in CDWave and TLH to 16-bit/48kHz by john m on 2013-04-01 [2]",
